{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_038F80","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"在Mother Base住习惯了吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":32,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"嗯。跟山里的生活相比，这里简直是<R=天堂,HEAVEN>。也不用再被<R=国民警卫队,LA GUARDIA>和雇佣兵追着跑了。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=天堂,HEAVEN>\", \"<R=国民警卫队,LA GUARDIA>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":140,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"不过最近来这里的人里，也有以前当过雇佣兵的……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"没事，我们相处得很好。一开始也闹过些矛盾，但真正聊过以后，就会发现他们也只是普通人。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":126,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"这样啊。那我就放心了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"是啊……就算分成敌我双方互相厮杀，对方也终究只是人……<R=CIA,LA CIA>的雇佣兵也好，<R=国民警卫队,LA GUARDIA>也好……还有美国的普通民众，应该也一样。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=CIA,LA CIA>\", \"<R=国民警卫队,LA GUARDIA>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":206,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"怎么突然说起这个？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"<R=父亲,MI VIEJO>为了筹集革命资金，参与了毒品提炼。完全听KGB的安排。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=父亲,MI VIEJO>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":94,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"“一切都是为了<R=祖国,NICARAGUA>”……我一直这样说服自己，对这件事视而不见。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=祖国,NICARAGUA>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":107,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"可到头来，那其实是在帮忙让美国的年轻人染上毒瘾……我终于明白了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":96,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"是啊。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"……我决定了。就算离开<R= 这里 ,MOTHER BASE>、回到革命中，我也不会再碰毒品提炼。也不会再依赖KGB。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R= 这里 ,MOTHER BASE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":135,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED; SOURCE_RUBY_SPACING_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"就算靠KGB和毒品资金打倒Somoza，人民的心也一定会离我们而去。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"为了自己的私欲让<R=他人,HITO>遭受不幸……那样的话，我们和Somoza就没区别了。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=他人,HITO>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":105,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"也就是说，你要走一条和父亲不同的路。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"我现在依然尊敬<R=父亲,MI VIEJO>。只是，我做事的方式和他不同。仅此而已。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=父亲,MI VIEJO>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":100,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"这样啊。Chico也会高兴的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":35,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"Chico也已经是个独当一面的战士了。我不想做出让我没脸见他的事。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":89,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"说得好，Amanda。越来越有<R=司令官,COMANDANTE>的样子了。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=司令官,COMANDANTE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"别这么说……那是因为最出色的<R=司令官,COMANDANTE>就在我身边啊，Boss。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=司令官,COMANDANTE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":94,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":20,"cn_text":"唔……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":21,"cn_text":"呵呵……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""}]}